ty failure; snapshot retention still bounds stored copies. Gap-2 is answered and the question is marked explained.\\n\\nControl caveat handled honestly: in that receipt the leader's control comparison came back unknown ('No corresponding prerequisite events reached: control_window/window_start') because both nodes emitted one shared end-event name, so the control is supported only by the operands recorded in the same receipt (indices 2 and 4: should_snapshot false, log store index equal to snapshot index, 1 distinct snapshot ID at index 202 with applied_delta 0). A successor experiment is therefore requested with previous_id 0620c91eb9c641de9723369bd4729fd6-experiment, a documented revision reason, and a harness that differs only in event naming (recovered_window_end / control_window_start / control_window_end) with identical producers, configuration and window; the local run of that successor reproduced the same split (15 vs 1 distinct IDs). Validation of these bytes returns valid:true.\"}"}}
